---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About TRADE90 — Market Research & Risk Management Workspace"
  description="TRADE90 is a research and risk-management workspace for traders. Compare sourced market conditions, plan risk, size positions, and review decisions."
  keywords={["TRADE90", "market research", "forex research", "gold research", "bitcoin research", "risk management", "position sizing", "trading journal"]}
>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-16 px-6">

    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-10">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-emerald-500 transition-colors">Home</a></li>
        <li class="text-slate-800">/</li>
        <li class="text-slate-500" aria-current="page">About</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <p class="text-emerald-500 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-3">Research · Risk · Review</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter mb-5">TRADE90 is a research and risk-management workspace for disciplined traders.</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-12">
      The goal is simple: make it easier to separate market evidence from assumptions, define risk before execution, and review decisions after the fact.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <article class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-500 mb-2">Research</p>
          <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-black tracking-tight mb-3">Understand the market</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Compare indicative prices, market structure, macro observations, events, positioning, policy context and source dates without presenting the output as a trade signal.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-500 mb-2">Plan</p>
          <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-black tracking-tight mb-3">Define the decision</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Use the research-plan builder, position-size tools and risk calculators to document assumptions, invalidation points and exposure before acting.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-500 mb-2">Review</p>
          <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-black tracking-tight mb-3">Learn from the process</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Use the journal and daily dashboard to track outcomes, plan adherence and risk usage so the process can improve over time.</p>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter mb-4">What the research terminal covers</h2>
        <p>
          The terminal currently covers seven major FX pairs plus Gold and Bitcoin. Research sources update on different schedules, so TRADE90 keeps observation dates and source context visible instead of treating every data point as equally fresh.
        </p>
        <ul class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-3 list-none p-0 mt-6">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-emerald-500">→</span><span>Indicative market prices and recent price structure</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-emerald-500">→</span><span>Economic and policy observations with source dates</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-emerald-500">→</span><span>Event and positioning context where available</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-emerald-500">→</span><span>Research limitations and source coverage</span></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter mb-4">How the research is built</h2>
        <p>
          TRADE90 uses an automated research pipeline to retrieve, normalize and timestamp supported market and macro observations. Deterministic calculations are used for price structure, rolling volatility and changes between observations. The interface then separates observed data, synthesis and limitations instead of hiding them behind a single directional score.
        </p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-5">
          <article class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-5">
            <p class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-500 mb-1">Sources</p>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">Observation dates and source context stay visible where the feed provides them.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-5">
            <p class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-500 mb-1">Automation</p>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">Automation organizes changing evidence; it does not invent missing values or hidden trade calls.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-5">
            <p class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-500 mb-1">Limits</p>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">Different data cadences, price bases and coverage gaps are disclosed rather than treated as equivalent.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-2xl p-7">
        <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-400 mb-3">Method</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-white mb-3">Evidence first, certainty second.</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400">
          TRADE90 does not treat a single indicator, narrative or model output as proof of what the market will do next. The research experience is designed to show what is observed, what is inferred, what is missing and when the underlying information was last updated.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-5">
          <a href="/research-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-11 px-4 rounded-lg bg-emerald-900/40 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-300 font-bold text-sm hover:text-white transition-colors">Read the research guide</a>
          <a href="/editorial-policy/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-11 px-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 font-bold text-sm hover:text-white transition-colors">Editorial & research policy</a>
          <a href="/research/" class="inline-flex items-center min-h-11 px-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 font-bold text-sm hover:text-white transition-colors">Current research</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter mb-4">The TRADE90 workflow</h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <a href="/" class="block bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500/40 rounded-xl p-5 transition-colors">
            <p class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-500 mb-1">01 · Research</p>
            <p class="text-white font-black">Open the market terminal</p>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">Compare the latest evidence and market conditions.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/tools/trading-plan-builder/" class="block bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500/40 rounded-xl p-5 transition-colors">
            <p class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-500 mb-1">02 · Plan</p>
            <p class="text-white font-black">Write the decision plan</p>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">Record the view, uncertainty, risk and invalidation conditions.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/tools/position-size-calculator/" class="block bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500/40 rounded-xl p-5 transition-colors">
            <p class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-500 mb-1">03 · Risk</p>
            <p class="text-white font-black">Calculate exposure</p>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">Size a position from account risk and stop distance.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/journal/" class="block bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500/40 rounded-xl p-5 transition-colors">
            <p class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-500 mb-1">04 · Review</p>
            <p class="text-white font-black">Review the decision</p>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">Track outcome, R-multiple and plan adherence.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm border-t border-slate-800 pt-8">
        TRADE90 is an independent research and education product. Market information is indicative and may be delayed or incomplete. It is not brokerage execution, personalized investment advice, or a promise of future results.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
